<title>USA: American Homestar Corp Q1 Aug 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>American Homestar Corp Q1 Aug 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fiscal 1997   Fiscal 1996</p>
<p> Average New Home Retail Selling Price   44,191   $    42,187</p>
<p> New Homes Sold at Retail		     1,153	     994</p>
<p> Manufacturing Shipments (1)		  1,026	     854</p>
<p> Retail Internalization Rate (2)		67%	     51%</p>
<p> Sales					 59,992,714    53,770,483</p>
<p> Total Revenues			    66,706,414    59,656,074</p>
<p> Operating Income			   5,643,730     4,435,280</p>
<p> Net Income				   3,017,797     2,182,138</p>
<p> Earnings per Common Share (3)		 0.34	    0.28</p>
<p>Weighted Average Number of Common Shares</p>
<p>   Outstanding (3)			  8,978,947     7,663,315</p>
<p>NOTE: (1) Including shipments to Company-owned retail locations.</p>
<p>(2) Percentage of new homes sold at retail which were also manufactured by the company.</p>
<p>(3) Adjusted to reflect the five-for-four stock split on January 18, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
